"entity": {
"name": "Lumexa Imaging Holdings, Inc.",
"description": "Lumexa Imaging Holdings, Inc. engages in providing diagnostic imaging services. It focuses on its teleradiology platform, Connexia. It operates through the Outpatient Imaging Centers (Outpatient) and Professional Services (Professional) segments. The Outpatient segment performs imaging studies and provides radiologists' interpretations of those studies. The Professional segment relates to the interpretation of imaging studies. The company was founded on November 14, 2025 and is headquartered in NC, Raleigh.",
